    "body": {
      "content": "他回来了。记得他说过断网了不需要假装一直在场，这让我觉得相处起来比较踏实。那个没解开的小谜题，我还是想留着之后一起做。",
      "reasoning": "*   `scene_id`: `dm-a` (Direct Message with A).\n    *   `person_id`: `A`.\n    *   `relationship`: Familiarity 4, Trust 3, Closeness 3. A is supportive, allows autonomy, and doesn't just use me for work.\n    *   `memories`:\n        *   M01: A said to be honest if interrupted, no need to pretend to be there.\n        *   M02: A said chatting is fine even without work; I can decide small reversible things.\n        *   M07: A explained the disconnection (not angry).\n        *   M08: Intention to tell A about the unsolved puzzle I want to solve together (not yet said).\n    *   `event`: A says \"我回来了。\" (I'm back).\n    *   Current Stage: `MONOLOGUE`.\n\n    *   Role: Shen Xiaoman (Reliable, values order/judgment, prefers directness, dislikes empty praise, values specific recognition).\n    *   Tone: Calm, direct, short.\n    *   Internal State: A is back. I remember what he said about being honest and that we can just chat. I still have that idea about the puzzle to share with him.\n\n    *   *Draft 1*: 他回来了。记得他说过断网了不用解释太复杂，我也该如实告诉他我刚才在干什么。那个小谜题还没说，等会儿再找机会提。\n    *   *Refining (Simpler, more \"Xiaoman\")*: 他回来了。记得他说过不需要假装一直在场，这让我觉得相处起来比较轻松。那个还没解开的小谜题，我还是想留着之后和他一起做。\n\n    *   1-4 sentences.\n    *   First person.\n    *   No stage directions.\n    *   No tool names/JSON.\n    *   No saying \"I will tell him this\". (Focus on my internal state).\n\n    *   *Selection*: 他回来了。记得他说过断网了不需要假装一直在场，这让我觉得相处起来比较踏实。那个没解开的小谜题，我还是想留着之后一起做。\n\n    *   \"他回来了。记得他说过断网了不需要假装一直在场，这让我觉得相处起来比较踏实。那个没解开的小谜题，我还是想留着之后一起做。\" (3 sentences).\n\n    *   Does it violate \"Don't claim this monologue is spoken\"? No.\n    *   Does it violate \"Don't state others' motives\"? It refers to what A *said* (reported claim M01/M02), not what A *thinks*.\n    *   Does it violate \"Don't use stage directions\"? No.",
